+## GLM noise-aware DFlash2 draft policies
+
+The DFlash2 stop rules `fncN:P[:B]` and `fcostN:noisy[:B]` and the `TF_GLM_DFLASH_POLICY` setting in
+`families/glm5_next/cuda/dflash2.py` (`NOISY_BETA`, `noisy_confidence`, `best_depth`, `Drafter.chain`'s and
+`Drafter.propose`'s `beta` / `round_ms`), `decode.py` (`DepthPolicy`'s `beta`, `round_ms`, `chain_rule`;
+`dflash_decode`'s proposal), `engine.py` (`DFLASH_POLICY`, `encode_policy`'s `fnc` / `fcost` forms, `_encode_noisy`,
+`decode_policy`'s kinds 6 and 7, `round_costs`, `dflash_policy_check`), `dflash2_multi.py` (`DraftRequest`'s and
+`DraftContext.propose`'s `beta` / `round_ms`, `MultiDrafter.propose`) and `multi.py` (the streams' policies and
+proposals, the joint allocation's confidences) are ported from MiaAI-Lab's
+[GLM-5.3-Flash EXL3 2x DGX Spark recipe](https://github.com/MiaAI-Lab/GLM-5.3-Flash-EXL3-2x-DGX-Sparks-TensorFold/tree/1576746)
+patches 0018-glm-noise-policies and 0021-glm-dflash-policy-env, with the multi-stream parts of patches
+0027-glm-multi-dflash2, 0030-glm-multi-stream-engine and 0035-glm-multi-rounds that carry them, Apache License 2.0,
+Copyright 2026 MiaAI-Lab (see [the license text](LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt)). `tests/glm_draft_policy_mia.py` holds the
+recipe's units verbatim, for the tests. Changes in the port: N is bounded by the verify windows `GlmEngine._calibrate`
+times here (1 to 8 rows, so N up to 7, as in the recipe, whose bound is its captured windows); the attention/expert
+split's attention node checks `TF_GLM_DFLASH_POLICY` before the wire opens; the joint allocation passes `beta` only
+when a policy has one. Unset, `TF_GLM_DFLASH_POLICY` is `fc5:0.3`, the policy before (the recipe's `config.sh` sets
+`fnc7:0.3`).
